      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Emboss reads the picture's brightness as height and lights it from one side, so a flat noise stands up like beaten copper. The Master Gear turns Light Angle once a loop and the Colorize tints the gray. Turn Strength, or set Mode to Deboss to press it in."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
